>> title: Romesco
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: almond, red pepper, spanish, sauce, skillet
>> counters: Deli, The Bowl Shop
>> aka: romesco sauce, salsa romesco
>> servings: 8
>> time: 40 min

>> step: soak 20 min in hot water
Soak @dried ñora chiles{2}(stemmed and seeded; or 1 ancho) in hot water for ~{20%min}.

>> step: fry 4 min until golden
Fry @blanched almonds{1/2%cup}(70 g) and @rustic bread{1%slice}(torn into pieces) in @extra-virgin olive oil{1/3%cup}(80 mL) in a #skillet{} for ~{4%min}, until golden.

>> step: pound to a coarse paste
Pound @&(~1)fried bread and almonds{} with @garlic{2%cloves} and @kosher salt{1%tsp} to a coarse paste in a #mortar{}.

>> step: pound in
Pound @&(~3)drained chiles{} into @&(~1)paste{} with @roasted tomatoes{2}(peeled) and @smoked paprika{1%tsp}.

>> step: whisk in
Whisk @sherry vinegar{2%Tbs}(30 mL) into @&(~1)romesco{}.
